# Files that must never be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# The Vercel CLI does NOT read .gitignore when it uploads a deployment - only its
# own built-in list plus this file - so anything kept out of git must be listed
# here too, or a manual `vercel` deploy ships it anyway.
#
# Generated reports, guides, walkthroughs, invoices, proposals and proof screenshots.
# Root-anchored on purpose: public/ holds real site images (public/email/*.png is
# used by the emails), so an unanchored *.png or *.pdf rule would break the site.
/*.html
/*.pdf
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.docx
/*.xlsx
/*.csv
qa-shots/
qa-evidence/
qa-regression/
figma-refs/

# Generated end-to-end test reports.
/e2e-report/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
